Z||000035||Will||03-26-2001||12:28 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by bubbajoexx:<BR><B>I worked on a smashed aruora for 2 mounts to rebiuld the damaged harness severd at the left door piller and after all the reading and pin to pin reconects 250 wires there are 6 sub system computer and 1 body computer that are all inter connected to the main pcm <BR>if two or more systems fail in the car limp mode will be trigerd and the only way to stop this is to reprogram the code in the pcm  the main systems that cause the service engine light are steering hvac anti lock and transmisson after 2mounths i got quit famillar with the aroura systems</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Do you still have the manual?<BR>could you post some reference pages I could look up?<BR>I haven't been through the whole manual, but from looking through the DTC definitions I don't recall anything like what you describe abouty the ABS, HVAC, or steering systems.||||reg||1
